*   Non-medical use of AAS among college students is at or less than 1%.
*   13% of steroid users reported unsafe injection practices such as reusing needles, sharing needles, and sharing multidose vials.
*   Sharing of needles is extremely uncommon among individuals using AAS for non-medical purposes, less than 1%.
*   74% of non-medical AAS users had post-secondary degrees and more had completed college and fewer had failed to complete.

